Miko: Yeah, that’s not easy, Pum. How can I help you?
Pum: Well, I hate to say this, but his new girlfriend is Japanese. ____(15)____ she lives in Tokyo, like you. They met when she was an exchange student here in Thailand. Since you are Japanese and were also an exchange student, ____(16)____
Miko: Of course! Losing a boyfriend to another girl is hard.
Pum: I know! He even sent her a ring last week to show he’s ____(17)____
Miko: Oh, that’s romantic. ____(18)____ , did he ever give you a ring, too?
Pum: Yes, he said we would be together forever. It’s a beautiful ring of a pink cherry blossom. I’ll show it to you. (Pum holds the ring up to the camera.) Can you see it?
Miko: OH NO! And inside the ring, are there words: “Life will always be Springtime with you”?
Pum: Huh? What? How do you know that?
Miko: And your boyfriend’s name is Oak?
Pum: Yes, yes. But, Miko, how do you know that?
Miko: Oh, that terrible, awful guy! Pum -- our rings are identical! When I was an exchange student in Thailand, I met a guy named Oak. He ____(19)____ me that he had no girlfriend. We fell in love, but I had to come back to Japan. He lied to me! And he lied to you! Pum -- you are his girlfriend in Thailand, and I am his girlfriend in Tokyo! ____(20)____ I can’t believe it! I’m so-o-o angry!
Pum: Call him NOW, Miko, and break up with him. He’s no good. Break his heart just like he broke ours!','["We’re so lucky!", "He’s a dream come true.", "He gave us the same rings.", "We should celebrate together."]'::jsonb,2,array[2]::smallint[],'["Miko พบว่าแหวนของทั้งคู่เหมือนกัน (our rings are identical) → He gave us the same rings."]'::jsonb,'["ไม่ถูก We’re so lucky! ขัดกับความโกรธ", "ไม่ถูก He’s a dream come true. ขัดกับ terrible, awful guy", "ถูก He gave us the same rings.", "ไม่ถูก ฉลองด้วยกันขัดกับ I’m so angry!"]'::jsonb,'{"after": "20. เลือกคำตอบที่เหมาะสมที่สุดสำหรับช่องว่าง ____(20)____", "topic": "1.2", "n": 20}'::jsonb,'imported_m6','imported',false,null,'Exam Gym ม.6 · 5620e4c',2568,'eng:68-20');
