- Encourage children to take risks during their learning process; this will help them experiment with new ideas without fear of failure or embarrassment
- Build on existing knowledge rather than starting from scratch
- Provide an opportunity for students to share their work with others.','["It involves risk-taking activities.", "It can be defined in different ways.", "It is a combination of various skills.", "It is useful only for business and science."]'::jsonb,3,array[3]::smallint[],'["ย่อหน้า 2: Creativity can be applied in any field including education, business, science"]'::jsonb,'["ไม่ถูก (ข้อความนี้เป็นจริง) involves taking risks", "ไม่ถูก (ข้อความนี้เป็นจริง) There is no one definition", "ไม่ถูก (ข้อความนี้เป็นจริง) a combination of many different skills", "ถูก (ไม่จริง) ใช้ได้ทุกสาขา ไม่ใช่แค่ธุรกิจและวิทยาศาสตร์"]'::jsonb,'{"after": "54. Which of the following statements is NOT true about creativity?", "topic": "2.5", "n": 54}'::jsonb,'imported_m6','imported',false,null,'Exam Gym ม.6 · 5620e4c',2568,'eng:68-54');
