Situation: Two friends discuss a volunteer trip
Arm: Did you sign up for the beach clean-up this weekend?
Joy: Not yet. ____(26)____
Arm: It starts at 7 a.m. at Bang Saen Beach. The school bus leaves at 5:30.
Joy: That’s so early! ____(27)____
Arm: Come on. It’ll be fun, and we’ll get volunteer hours for our portfolio.
Joy: ____(28)____ What should I bring?
Arm: A hat, sunscreen, and a refillable water bottle. ____(29)____
Joy: Got it. I’ll sign up tonight.
